    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 After subsection 2(1)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) If a Commission is constituted by 2 or more members, a hearing of\nthe Commission may be held by one or more members of the\nCommission if each of the members holding the hearing is either:\n\n(a) the President or Chair of the Commission; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\n(b) authorised in writing by the President or Chair of the\nCommission to hold authorised member hearings in relation\nto the Commission.\n\n(1B) The following person presides at an authorised member hearing:\n\n(a) the President or Chair of the Commission;\n\n(b) if the President or Chair is not one of the members holding an\nauthorised member hearing—the member of the Commission\nwho is authorised in writing by the President or Chair to\npreside at the hearing.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(1A) If a Commission is constituted by 2 or more members, a hearing of\nthe Commission may be held by one or more members of the\nCommission if each of the members holding the hearing is either:\n\n(a) the President or Chair of the Commission; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\n(b) authorised in writing by the President or Chair of the\nCommission to hold authorised member hearings in relation\nto the Commission.\n\n(1B) The following person presides at an authorised member hearing:\n\n(a) the President or Chair of the Commission;\n\n(b) if the President or Chair is not one of the members holding an\nauthorised member hearing—the member of the Commission\nwho is authorised in writing by the President or Chair to\npreside at the hearing.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-8-ss-1a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-8-ss-1b"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 After subsection 2(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) If a Commission is constituted by 2 or more members, a hearing of\nthe Commission may be held by one or more members of the\nCommission if each of the members holding the hearing is either:\n\n(a) the President or Chair of the Commission; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\n(b) authorised in writing by the President or Chair of the\nCommission to hold authorised member hearings in relation\nto the Commission.\n\n(1B) The following person presides at an authorised member hearing:\n\n(a) the President or Chair of the Commission;\n\n(b) if the President or Chair is not one of the members holding an\nauthorised member hearing—the member of the Commission\nwho is authorised in writing by the President or Chair to\npreside at the hearing."
    },
