      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(7) The references in subsections (3) and (6) to the matters into which\nthe Commission was inquiring are, for a Commission that holds an\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nauthorised member hearing, references to the matters into which\nthe Commission as a whole was inquiring.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n(7) The references in subsections (3) and (6) to the matters into which\nthe Commission was inquiring are, for a Commission that holds an\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nauthorised member hearing, references to the matters into which\nthe Commission as a whole was inquiring.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-12-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7456720126731dad1bf5d96afc71a996d9cc844ba4f8ad946f28442a876c19dc",
      "skos:note": "Amendments to Schedule 1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-12",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12 At the end of section 3 (after the note)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(7) The references in subsections (3) and (6) to the matters into which\nthe Commission was inquiring are, for a Commission that holds an\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nauthorised member hearing, references to the matters into which\nthe Commission as a whole was inquiring."
    },
