    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oc-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6OC(3) Status of private session",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-6oc-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The following provisions apply as if information, a document,\nrecord or other thing obtained by one or 2 members of the Child\nSexual Abuse Royal Commission at a private session were\nproduced before, delivered or given to, or otherwise obtained or\nreceived by, the Commission:\n\n(a) section 6F (power of Commission in relation to documents\nand other things);\n\n(b) section 6P (Commission may communicate information);\n\n(c) section 9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The following provisions apply as if information, a document,\nrecord or other thing obtained by one or 2 members of the Child\nSexual Abuse Royal Commission at a private session were\nproduced before, delivered or given to, or otherwise obtained or\nreceived by, the Commission:\n\n(a) section 6F (power of Commission in relation to documents\nand other things);\n\n(b) section 6P (Commission may communicate information);\n\n(c) section 9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oc"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oc-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oc-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e168a68f1179c7600eb43d5b5861847f5385460ed5403fd7bafe8031da74dbc3",
      "skos:note": "Provisions apply as if information obtained at a private session were produced before the Commission."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-6oc-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6OC(3) Status of private session",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The following provisions apply as if information, a document,\nrecord or other thing obtained by one or 2 members of the Child\nSexual Abuse Royal Commission at a private session were\nproduced before, delivered or given to, or otherwise obtained or\nreceived by, the Commission:\n\n(a) section 6F (power of Commission in relation to documents\nand other things);\n\n(b) section 6P (Commission may communicate information);\n\n(c) section 9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission)."
    },
    {
