    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6of",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6OF Protection of those who appear, or are authorised to be",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-6of"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "present, at a private session\n\n(1) Any person who appears, or is authorised to be present, at a private\nsession has the same protection and, in addition to the penalties\nprovided by this Act, is to be subject to the same liabilities in any\ncivil or criminal proceeding, as a witness in any case tried in the\nHigh Court.\n\n(2) A legal practitioner who appears on behalf of a person at a private\nsession has the same protection and immunity as a barrister has in\nappearing for a party in proceedings in the High Court.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1",
      "skos:definition": "present, at a private session\n\n(1) Any person who appears, or is authorised to be present, at a private\nsession has the same protection and, in addition to the penalties\nprovided by this Act, is to be subject to the same liabilities in any\ncivil or criminal proceeding, as a witness in any case tried in the\nHigh Court.\n\n(2) A legal practitioner who appears on behalf of a person at a private\nsession has the same protection and immunity as a barrister has in\nappearing for a party in proceedings in the High Court.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6of-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6of-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2c1be1cffc28837e0d81b86608b7e67a89017abf93742eb073205217c658c120"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-6of",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6OF Protection of those who appear, or are authorised to be",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "present, at a private session\n\n(1) Any person who appears, or is authorised to be present, at a private\nsession has the same protection and, in addition to the penalties\nprovided by this Act, is to be subject to the same liabilities in any\ncivil or criminal proceeding, as a witness in any case tried in the\nHigh Court.\n\n(2) A legal practitioner who appears on behalf of a person at a private\nsession has the same protection and immunity as a barrister has in\nappearing for a party in proceedings in the High Court.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1"
    },
