      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) Any person who appears, or is authorised to be present, at a private session has the same protection and...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...is to be subject to the same liabilities in any civil or criminal proceeding, as a witness in any case tried in the High Court."
    },
