    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6og",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6OG Privacy of private sessions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-6og"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "A private session must be held in private, and only persons who are\nauthorised by a member of the Child Sexual Abuse Royal\nCommission holding the private session may be present during the\nprivate session.",
      "skos:definition": "A private session must be held in private, and only persons who are\nauthorised by a member of the Child Sexual Abuse Royal\nCommission holding the private session may be present during the\nprivate session.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6og-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6og-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6og-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7a01d284ca9c1ac2b008ff8d4d71288da306867ac43f62ec248ba5a7c801263b",
      "skos:note": "Only authorised persons may be present during a private session."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-6og",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6OG Privacy of private sessions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "A private session must be held in private, and only persons who are\nauthorised by a member of the Child Sexual Abuse Royal\nCommission holding the private session may be present during the\nprivate session."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6og-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6og"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6og-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "onlyIf",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Authorized presence",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Private session must be held in private.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Only persons authorized by a member may be present."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6og-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "mustBe",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Authorized presence requirement",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Only persons who are authorized by a member may be present during the private session.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Authorized presence is required."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oh",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6OH Offence for unauthorised use or disclosure of information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-6oh"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "given at a private session\n\nA person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person obtains information:\n\n(i) at a private session; or\n\n(ii) that was given at a private session; and\n\n(b) the person makes a record of, uses or discloses the\ninformation; and\n\n(c) none of the following applies:\n\n(i) the record, use or disclosure is for the purposes of\nperforming functions or duties or exercising powers in\nrelation to the Child Sexual Abuse Royal Commission;\n\n(ii) the person is authorised to make the record of, or use,\ndisclose or publish, the information in accordance with\nsection 6OJ (inclusion of information in reports and\nrecommendations), 6P (Commission may communicate\ninformation) or 9 (custody and use of records of\nCommission);\n\n(iii) the person gave the information at the private session;\n\n(iv) the person makes the record of, uses or discloses the\ninformation with the consent of the person who gave the\ninformation at the private session.\nPenalty: 20 penalty units or imprisonment for 12 months or both.\nNote:\nFor a defence to this offence, see section 6OK.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "given at a private session\n\nA person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person obtains information:\n\n(i) at a private session; or\n\n(ii) that was given at a private session; and\n\n(b) the person makes a record of, uses or discloses the\ninformation; and\n\n(c) none of the following applies:\n\n(i) the record, use or disclosure is for the purposes of\nperforming functions or duties or exercising powers in\nrelation to the Child Sexual Abuse Royal Commission;\n\n(ii) the person is authorised to make the record of, or use,\ndisclose or publish, the information in accordance with\nsection 6OJ (inclusion of information in reports and\nrecommendations), 6P (Commission may communicate\ninformation) or 9 (custody and use of records of\nCommission);\n\n(iii) the person gave the information at the private session;\n\n(iv) the person makes the record of, uses or discloses the\ninformation with the consent of the person who gave the\ninformation at the private session.\nPenalty: 20 penalty units or imprisonment for 12 months or both.\nNote:\nFor a defence to this offence, see section 6OK.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oh-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oh-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5b7e74559e156cec0ef74c87df9c8452ee57bd83cb8aa95ff4ed1adb957b08d1",
      "skos:note": "Unauthorised use or disclosure of information is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-6oh",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6OH Offence for unauthorised use or disclosure of information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "given at a private session\n\nA person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person obtains information:\n\n(i) at a private session; or\n\n(ii) that was given at a private session; and\n\n(b) the person makes a record of, uses or discloses the\ninformation; and\n\n(c) none of the following applies:\n\n(i) the record, use or disclosure is for the purposes of\nperforming functions or duties or exercising powers in\nrelation to the Child Sexual Abuse Royal Commission;\n\n(ii) the person is authorised to make the record of, or use,\ndisclose or publish, the information in accordance with\nsection 6OJ (inclusion of information in reports and\nrecommendations), 6P (Commission may communicate\ninformation) or 9 (custody and use of records of\nCommission);\n\n(iii) the person gave the information at the private session;\n\n(iv) the person makes the record of, uses or discloses the\ninformation with the consent of the person who gave the\ninformation at the private session.\nPenalty: 20 penalty units or imprisonment for 12 months or both.\nNote:\nFor a defence to this offence, see section 6OK.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oh-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oh"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
