    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6om",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6OM Relationship with the Archives Act 1983",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-6om"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of the Archives Act 1983, a record:\n\n(a) that contains information obtained at a private session; or\n\n(b) that relates to a private session and identifies a natural person\nwho appeared at a private session;\nis in the open access period on and after 1 January in the year that\nis 99 years after the calendar year that the record came into\nexistence.\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) applies in relation to a record even\nif the record came into existence after the private session.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\n(3) Subsection 3(7) and section 56 of the Archives Act 1983 do not\napply to a record referred to in subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of the Archives Act 1983, a record:\n\n(a) that contains information obtained at a private session; or\n\n(b) that relates to a private session and identifies a natural person\nwho appeared at a private session;\nis in the open access period on and after 1 January in the year that\nis 99 years after the calendar year that the record came into\nexistence.\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) applies in relation to a record even\nif the record came into existence after the private session.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\n(3) Subsection 3(7) and section 56 of the Archives Act 1983 do not\napply to a record referred to in subsection (1).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6om-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6om-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6om-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "52675b668d6379f1b6b54d391cef89a2dde48f749ab5f8cc277f950f907bf916"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-6om",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6OM Relationship with the Archives Act 1983",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of the Archives Act 1983, a record:\n\n(a) that contains information obtained at a private session; or\n\n(b) that relates to a private session and identifies a natural person\nwho appeared at a private session;\nis in the open access period on and after 1 January in the year that\nis 99 years after the calendar year that the record came into\nexistence.\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) applies in relation to a record even\nif the record came into existence after the private session.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\n(3) Subsection 3(7) and section 56 of the Archives Act 1983 do not\napply to a record referred to in subsection (1)."
    },
