      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of the Archives Act 1983, a record:\n\n(a) that contains information obtained at a private session; or\n\n(b) that relates to a private session and identifies a natural person\nwho appeared at a private session;\nis in the open access period on and after 1 January in the year that\nis 99 years after the calendar year that the record came into\nexistence.",
